    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1156-a1">

                <pb facs="1233" n="1137" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1137"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July 15,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minister, Caracas:</hi></p>
                <p>Santiago de Cuba, with eastern half province of Santiago, surrendered yesterday.
                    Surrendered Spanish troops to be sent to Spain.</p>
            </div>
